      "content": "It is a profound misunderstanding to believe that your presence is a burden; your worth is inherent and absolutely not dependent on your achievements. The desire to protect your parents from disappointment is coming from a place of deep love, but that love should also allow you to see yourself as worthy. Instead of trying to erase yourself, consider reaching out to someone who can help you process this guilt and shame. Please connect with a professional or a trusted helpline today.",
